WEBVTT

35:32.163 --> 35:33.955
Welcome to Pizza Planet.

35:35.249 --> 35:37.751
The white zone
is for immediate pizza...

35:38.336 --> 35:39.336
Sheriff!

35:41.088 --> 35:42.506
There you are.

35:43.090 --> 35:45.884
Now, the entrance is heavily guarded.
We need a way to get inside.

35:47.929 --> 35:49.179
Great idea, Woody.

35:49.263 --> 35:51.389
I like your thinkin'.

35:52.183 --> 35:55.352
You are clear to enter.
Welcome to Pizza Planet.

35:55.436 --> 35:57.103
Now!

35:57.188 --> 36:00.023
Quickly, Sheriff!
The air lock is closing.
